  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "While filming in Varginha, Brazil, a town where witnesses say a strange creature was caught in 1996, the documentary maker James Fox got an unexpected request for a meeting from Italo Venturelli, the chief neurosurgeon at the town's Hospital Regional, which by this story's account came in through a back entrance. Fox tells it in a documentary clip on the show. It matters because a senior doctor at the hospital where the creature was said to be taken would be a key witness."
